(print "  - Functions (procs) and the flow operator ->")
(print "  - Collections, loops, map/filter/reduce")
(print "  - Note streams with durations, rests, and chords")
(print "  - Musical context (tempo, time signature, key)")
(print "  - Sections and song arrangement")
(print "  - Effects processing and audio export")
(print "  - Pattern transforms")
(print "  - Inline // and Note: comment styles")
(print "  - Mixing buffers with mix")
(print "  - Per-section gain for dynamic shaping")
(print "  - Synth presets: strings, organ, bell")
(print "  - Tempo ramps with tempoRamp (ritardando, accelerando)")
(print "  - Voice synthesis with sing (and tts for full text-to-speech)")
(print "  - Slicing arrays and sequences with `slice`")
(print "  - Enharmonic spellings: flat literals (`Bb`, `Db`, `Eb`...) and `enharmonic`")
(print "  - Per-voice reverb tails with `reverbTime`")
(print "  - MIDI velocity from `dynamics` and `crescendo`")
(print "  - Euclidean rhythms with `euclidean` (swing, humanize)")
(print "  - Dual export: `writeWav` (audio) + `writeMidi` (notation) from the same Song")
(print "")
(print "Your graduation piece:")
(print "  - WAV:  examples/output/flow_tutorial.wav")
(print "  - MIDI: examples/output/flow_tutorial.mid")
(print "Play the WAV with: aplay examples/output/flow_tutorial.wav")
(print "Open the MIDI in any DAW that imports SMF.")
(print "")
(print "Now go make some music! Happy composing.")
